16. Source check on analysis-model calls (raised by executor, steward#15). Objective text: the clean-room rule is "成片里不能有原片的任何一帧画面或一段音频，也不能把原片素材交给任何生成器"; §二 requires that "Reference 赛道的镜头表由它自己用上面的剪辑点检测从输入片段得出，描述用同一个描述模型"; run rules: "每次模型调用都经计费" and "每次工具调用经同一个工具服务…在源头拒绝来自原片的输入"; tool tiers list generators and editing tools only, not the description model. So the objective itself requires the description model to see frames of the input clip. It does not say in words whether model calls pass the source check. Steward reading from the text: the description model is not a generator, the rejection is stated for tool calls/generators, and screening it would make the required Reference step impossible; model calls are billed, logged, and their output (text) is what the pipeline uses. The objective is silent on exemption, so the maintainer may confirm or overrule; results are recorded with this reading stated.
